# Source reference blocks and apparatus.

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlock|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Source Content Block"
msgstr "来源内容块"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlock|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An atomic structural unit within one source division under the source's declared segmentation. It inherits ContentSegment identity; indivisibility constrains retrieval cuts rather than forbidding internal text, media or table-cell structure."
msgstr "来源所声明分段中某一划分内的原子结构单元。它继承 ContentSegment 的身份；不可分割性约束检索切分，而不禁止内部文本、媒体或表格单元格结构。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlock|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this explicit part of the source structure or apparatus with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留来源结构或论述装置的此明确部分及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlock|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, identity, formal truth or successful verification from document layout or source wording alone."
msgstr "避免仅从文档版式或来源措辞推断执行、身份、形式真理或核验成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlock|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve source identity and exact-statement attribution; keep unresolved or missing information explicit without invented defaults."
msgstr "保留来源身份与确切陈述归属；明确未解析或缺失的信息，而不虚构默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlock|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:record a gmeow:ContentBlock ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:record a gmeow:ContentBlock ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockOf|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "block of division"
msgstr "块所属划分"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The immediate source division containing a ContentBlock. It specializes segmentOf without inheriting its transitivity, so the direct container remains distinct from all structural ancestors."
msgstr "包含 ContentBlock 的直接来源划分。此关系特化 segmentOf，但不继承其传递性，因此直接容器区别于所有结构祖先。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this explicit part of the source structure or apparatus with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留来源结构或论述装置的此明确部分及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, identity, formal truth or successful verification from document layout or source wording alone."
msgstr "避免仅从文档版式或来源措辞推断执行、身份、形式真理或核验成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve source identity and exact-statement attribution; keep unresolved or missing information explicit without invented defaults."
msgstr "保留来源身份与确切陈述归属；明确未解析或缺失的信息，而不虚构默认值。"

