msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeTable|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A documentary table arranging source cells by rows and columns. It is not thereby a mathematical matrix of scalars."
msgstr "按行列排列来源单元格的文档表格。它不会因此成为标量的数学矩阵。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeTable|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this explicit part of the source structure or apparatus with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留来源结构或论述装置的此明确部分及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeTable|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, identity, formal truth or successful verification from document layout or source wording alone."
msgstr "避免仅从文档版式或来源措辞推断执行、身份、形式真理或核验成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeTable|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve source identity and exact-statement attribution; keep unresolved or missing information explicit without invented defaults."
msgstr "保留来源身份与确切陈述归属；明确未解析或缺失的信息，而不虚构默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeTable|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:block gmeow:segmentType gmeow:segmentTypeTable ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:block gmeow:segmentType gmeow:segmentTypeTable ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeFigure|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "figure"
msgstr "插图"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeFigure|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source figure unit, which may contain a media artifact and adjacent caption while remaining distinct from the media file itself."
msgstr "来源中的插图单元，可包含媒体制品和相邻说明文字，同时保持区别于媒体文件本身。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeFigure|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this explicit part of the source structure or apparatus with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留来源结构或论述装置的此明确部分及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeFigure|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, identity, formal truth or successful verification from document layout or source wording alone."
msgstr "避免仅从文档版式或来源措辞推断执行、身份、形式真理或核验成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeFigure|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve source identity and exact-statement attribution; keep unresolved or missing information explicit without invented defaults."
msgstr "保留来源身份与确切陈述归属；明确未解析或缺失的信息，而不虚构默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeFigure|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:block gmeow:segmentType gmeow:segmentTypeFigure ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:block gmeow:segmentType gmeow:segmentTypeFigure ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeFormalBlock|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "formal exposition block"
msgstr "形式论述块"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeFormalBlock|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source-designated unit of formal exposition whose printed role is carried separately by formalKind. Its layout alone establishes no mathematical truth."
msgstr "来源指定的形式论述单元，其印刷角色由 formalKind 单独承载。仅凭版式不能确立数学真理。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeFormalBlock|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this explicit part of the source structure or apparatus with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留来源结构或论述装置的此明确部分及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeFormalBlock|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, identity, formal truth or successful verification from document layout or source wording alone."
msgstr "避免仅从文档版式或来源措辞推断执行、身份、形式真理或核验成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeFormalBlock|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve source identity and exact-statement attribution; keep unresolved or missing information explicit without invented defaults."
msgstr "保留来源身份与确切陈述归属；明确未解析或缺失的信息，而不虚构默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeFormalBlock|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:block gmeow:segmentType gmeow:segmentTypeFormalBlock ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:block gmeow:segmentType gmeow:segmentTypeFormalBlock ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeEpigraph|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "epigraph"
msgstr "题辞"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeEpigraph|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source-designated introductory quotation or motto associated with a work or division."
msgstr "来源指定、与作品或划分相关联的引导性引文或格言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeEpigraph|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this explicit part of the source structure or apparatus with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留来源结构或论述装置的此明确部分及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeEpigraph|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, identity, formal truth or successful verification from document layout or source wording alone."
msgstr "避免仅从文档版式或来源措辞推断执行、身份、形式真理或核验成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeEpigraph|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve source identity and exact-statement attribution; keep unresolved or missing information explicit without invented defaults."
msgstr "保留来源身份与确切陈述归属；明确未解析或缺失的信息，而不虚构默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeEpigraph|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:block gmeow:segmentType gmeow:segmentTypeEpigraph ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:block gmeow:segmentType gmeow:segmentTypeEpigraph ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeQuotation|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "quotation block"
msgstr "引文块"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeQuotation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source-designated block of quoted material. The classification does not invent an author, quotation target or endorsement."
msgstr "来源指定的引用材料块。此分类不虚构作者、引文目标或认可。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeQuotation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this explicit part of the source structure or apparatus with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留来源结构或论述装置的此明确部分及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeQuotation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, identity, formal truth or successful verification from document layout or source wording alone."
msgstr "避免仅从文档版式或来源措辞推断执行、身份、形式真理或核验成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeQuotation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve source identity and exact-statement attribution; keep unresolved or missing information explicit without invented defaults."
msgstr "保留来源身份与确切陈述归属；明确未解析或缺失的信息，而不虚构默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/segmentTypeQuotation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:block gmeow:segmentType gmeow:segmentTypeQuotation ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:block gmeow:segmentType gmeow:segmentTypeQuotation ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlockContainerAcyclicConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "source block containment acyclicity"
msgstr "来源块容纳关系无环性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlockContainerAcyclicConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source block cannot reach itself through a nonempty chain of immediate block containers. The obligation preserves structural identity without executing a chunker."
msgstr "来源块不能通过非空的直接块容器链到达自身。此义务保留结构身份，而不执行检索分块器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlockContainerAcyclicConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of the supplied source inventory."
msgstr "用于检查所给来源清单的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlockContainerAcyclicConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this obligation executes a producer, parser, proof checker or table renderer."
msgstr "避免声称此义务执行生产器、解析器、证明检查器或表格呈现器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlockContainerAcyclicConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when a supplied structure violates the obligation; never repair it with invented defaults."
msgstr "当所给结构违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不使用虚构默认值修复它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlockContainerAcyclicConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:ContentBlockContainerAcyclicConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:blockOf ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:ContentBlockContainerAcyclicConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:blockOf ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlockPositionUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "source block position uniqueness"
msgstr "来源块位置唯一性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlockPositionUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Within one immediate source division, one structural index identifies one ContentBlock. Duplicate indices are rejected as conflicting records rather than merged by identity."
msgstr "在同一直接来源划分内，一个结构索引标识一个 ContentBlock。重复索引作为冲突记录被拒绝，而非通过身份合并。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlockPositionUniquenessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of the supplied source inventory."
msgstr "用于检查所给来源清单的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlockPositionUniquenessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this obligation executes a producer, parser, proof checker or table renderer."
msgstr "避免声称此义务执行生产器、解析器、证明检查器或表格呈现器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlockPositionUniquenessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when a supplied structure violates the obligation; never repair it with invented defaults."
msgstr "当所给结构违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不使用虚构默认值修复它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ContentBlockPositionUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:ContentBlockPositionUniquenessConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:blockOf ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:ContentBlockPositionUniquenessConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:blockOf ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/caption|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A caption for a media object or structural content segment, displayed alongside the content. Non-functional; a caption does not make a segment a MediaObject."
msgstr "为媒体对象或结构内容片段提供、在内容旁显示的说明文字。此属性非函数性；说明文字不会使片段成为 MediaObject。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/caption|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for short descriptive text displayed alongside media or a structural figure, table or other content segment; localized captions coexist."
msgstr "用于在媒体、结构性插图、表格或其他内容片段旁显示的简短描述文本；本地化说明文字可以共存。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/caption|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach the original literal with its language and direction. The schema profile uses schema:caption for actual MediaObjects and an explicitly lossy description for structural segments."
msgstr "附加原始字面量及其语言和书写方向。schema 配置对实际 MediaObject 使用 schema:caption，对结构片段使用明确有损的描述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/caption|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "caption"
msgstr "说明文字"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/caption|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid it for the full verbatim transcript of audio/video (use gmeow:transcript) and avoid it for the work's title (use gmeow:hasTitle / gmeow:title)."
msgstr "避免用于音视频的完整逐字转录（使用 gmeow:transcript），也避免用于作品标题（使用 gmeow:hasTitle / gmeow:title）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/caption|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A structural segment carries a displayed caption: ex:figure gmeow:caption \"Plan of the footbridge.\"@en ."
msgstr "结构片段承载显示的说明文字：ex:figure gmeow:caption \"Plan of the footbridge.\"@en ."

# IRI-valued media identity and exact MIME names.

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MediaType|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Media Type"
msgstr "媒体类型"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MediaType|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An open vocabulary of media-format values identified by IRIs. Registered MIME types use their IANA media-type resource; unregistered types use GMEOW media-types/<type>/<subtype> resources. Values are individuals, never carrier subclasses or charset encodings."
msgstr "由 IRI 标识的开放媒体格式值词汇。已注册 MIME 类型使用其 IANA 媒体类型资源；未注册类型使用 GMEOW media-types/<type>/<subtype> 资源。值是个体，不是载体子类或字符编码。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MediaType|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to identify a carrier's media format independently of its character encoding, natural language and MIME parameters."
msgstr "用于标识载体的媒体格式，独立于字符编码、自然语言和 MIME 参数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MediaType|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating a media type as a textual spelling, a language, a compression method or a Content-Type header including parameters."
msgstr "避免将媒体类型视为文本拼写、语言、压缩方法或包含参数的 Content-Type 标头。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MediaType|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the carrier through mediaType to the appropriate IANA or GMEOW value and record its exact parameter-free machine spelling through mediaTypeName."
msgstr "通过 mediaType 将载体关联到适当的 IANA 或 GMEOW 值，并通过 mediaTypeName 记录不含参数的精确机器拼写。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MediaType|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The vocabulary is open. Authored IRI policy does not perform registry lookup, normalize source strings or equate media identity with lang:profileEncoding or lang:renderingSerialization."
msgstr "词汇保持开放。所编写的 IRI 策略不查询注册表、不规范化来源字符串，也不将媒体身份等同于 lang:profileEncoding 或 lang:renderingSerialization。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MediaType|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Identify the format by its registered resource: ex:file gmeow:mediaType <https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/pdf> ."
msgstr "通过注册资源标识格式：ex:file gmeow:mediaType <https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/pdf> ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaTypeName|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "media type name"
msgstr "媒体类型名称"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaTypeName|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact parameter-free MIME type/subtype spelling denoted by a MediaType value, represented as xsd:string or xsd:token. It is a machine code, separate from the carrier's charset and other MIME parameters."
msgstr "MediaType 值表示的不含参数的精确 MIME 类型/子类型拼写，以 xsd:string 或 xsd:token 表示。这是机器代码，独立于载体的 charset 和其他 MIME 参数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaTypeName|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the exact MIME spelling of an identified media-type value is needed by a consumer or at a serialization boundary."
msgstr "用于使用方或序列化边界需要已标识媒体类型值的精确 MIME 拼写时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaTypeName|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid putting this code on the carrier as a sibling string media-type property, attaching a language tag, using xsd:token or appending charset or other parameters."
msgstr "避免将此代码作为平行的字符串媒体类型属性放在载体上、附加语言标签、使用 xsd:token，或拼接 charset 及其他参数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaTypeName|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Record the exact type/subtype string on the MediaType value; retain source spelling evidence separately when a source header contains casing, parameters or other syntax beyond that identity."
msgstr "在 MediaType 值上记录精确的类型/子类型字符串；若来源标头含有大小写形式、参数或超出该身份的语法，应单独保留来源拼写证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaTypeName|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The name does not establish IANA registration or authenticate a resource. No MIME parser, registry service, parameter extraction or string normalization is implied."
msgstr "名称不能证明 IANA 注册状态或认证资源，也不意味着存在 MIME 解析器、注册表服务、参数提取或字符串规范化。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaTypeName|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Record the machine spelling on the value: <https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/pdf> gmeow:mediaTypeName \"application/pdf\" ."
msgstr "在值上记录机器拼写：<https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/pdf> gmeow:mediaTypeName \"application/pdf\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaType|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "media type"
msgstr "媒体类型"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaType|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The media-format value of an entity, identified by an IANA resource IRI for a registered MIME type or a GMEOW media-types/<type>/<subtype> IRI for an unregistered type. The relation permits at most one value and does not require every entity to declare a format."
msgstr "实体的媒体格式值：已注册 MIME 类型使用 IANA 资源 IRI，未注册类型使用 GMEOW media-types/<type>/<subtype> IRI。该关系至多允许一个值，不要求每个实体声明格式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaType|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to identify the media format of a concrete carrier, such as an email body part, manifestation, image or downloadable distribution."
msgstr "用于标识具体载体的媒体格式，例如邮件正文部分、表现形式、图像或可下载分发文件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaType|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid literal MIME strings, parameter-bearing identity IRIs, charset or language values. Distinct encodings use distinct carriers rather than two media types on one carrier."
msgstr "避免使用 MIME 字符串字面量、带参数的身份 IRI，以及字符集或语言值。不同编码使用不同载体，不在同一载体上放置两种媒体类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaType|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Point to a MediaType value using the registered or unregistered IRI policy; keep charset on the carrier and the exact MIME spelling on the value's mediaTypeName. The schema.org bindings retain the same IRI as an encodingFormat URL value."
msgstr "按已注册或未注册 IRI 策略指向 MediaType 值；charset 保留在载体上，精确 MIME 拼写保留在值的 mediaTypeName 上。schema.org 绑定将同一 IRI 保留为 encodingFormat 的 URL 值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaType|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The Entity domain is retained. Functionality is at-most-one, without a universal presence requirement. Media identity is independent of character encoding, serialization profiles and source header parameters."
msgstr "保留 Entity 定义域。函数性表示至多一个值，不引入普遍存在要求。媒体身份独立于字符编码、序列化配置及来源标头参数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaType|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Identify the attachment format: ex:attachment gmeow:mediaType <https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/pdf> ."
msgstr "标识附件格式：ex:attachment gmeow:mediaType <https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/pdf> ."

msgctxt "https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/pdf|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "application/pdf media type"
msgstr "application/pdf 媒体类型"

msgctxt "https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/pdf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The registered application/pdf MIME media type identified by its IANA registry resource. This identity names the format independently of charset and other parameters."
msgstr "已注册的 MIME 媒体类型 application/pdf，由其 IANA 注册表资源标识。该身份命名格式，独立于字符集及其他参数。"

msgctxt "https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/pdf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
